{
  "$schema": "https://gen-animated-icons.lottiefiles.com/schema/icon-v2.json",
  "format": "gai-icon/2",
  "id": "tokenizer",
  "label": "Tokenizer",
  "intent": "The word is cut into tokens. Light: two cuts draw down through the word's boundaries, and as they fade the three cells spring apart into separate tokens and stop dead. Strong: the left cut lands, then the right, and the cells spring apart with a small overshoot and settle. The word line never moves; the tokens stay separate.",
